        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "1500DS Spirits Vol. 2: Shogi is a Japanese Shogi game for the Nintendo DS.\n\nFor beginners, there is a \"Teitei Learning Mode\"! In addition to the basic rules, you can also learn how to win.\n\nThe \"Go Evaluation Quiz\" is a fun way for beginners and Shogi lovers to deepen their knowledge, review, and check their skills.\n\nTo test your skills, you can also try the mission-clearing 'Challenge Mode' with 15 missions and 45 stages!\n\nYou can also play against other players with one software using DS Download Play!\n\nThe game features 18 different characters to play against!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2007",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
